<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="fmt" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/fmt" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Kardex | D'PAO COOKIES</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/app.css"></head><body><header><p>D'PAO COOKIES</p><h1>Kardex de movimientos</h1><%@ include file="nav.jspf" %></header><main><%@ include file="messages.jspf" %>
<section class="panel"><h2>Registrar movimiento</h2><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/kardex"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><div class="grid"><label>Clase de ítem<select name="item"><option value="insumo">Insumo</option><option value="producto">Producto</option></select></label><label>ID del ítem<input name="id" type="number" min="1" required></label><label>Tipo<select name="tipo"><option>ENTRADA</option><option>SALIDA</option><option>VENTA</option><option>MERMA</option></select></label><label>Cantidad<input name="cantidad" type="number" min="0.01" max="99999999.99" step="0.01" required></label></div><label>Motivo<input name="motivo" maxlength="255" required></label><button>Registrar movimiento</button></form><details><summary>Consultar identificadores de ítems</summary><c:forEach var="i" items="${insumos}"><p>Insumo ${i.idInsumo}: <c:out value="${i.nombre}"/></p></c:forEach><c:forEach var="p" items="${productos}"><p>Producto ${p.id_producto}: <c:out value="${p.nombre}"/></p></c:forEach></details></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Historial</h2><p>Las cantidades negativas indican salidas; las positivas, entradas. Los saldos muestran las existencias antes y después del movimiento.</p><form method="get" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/kardex"><div class="grid"><label>Tipo<select name="tipo"><option value="">Todos</option><c:forEach var="t" items="${['ENTRADA','SALIDA','VENTA','MERMA','AJUSTE']}"><option ${param.tipo == t ? 'selected' : ''}>${t}</option></c:forEach></select></label><label>Desde<input name="desde" type="date" value="<c:out value='${param.desde}'/>" ></label><label>Hasta<input name="hasta" type="date" value="<c:out value='${param.hasta}'/>" ></label></div><button>Filtrar</button></form><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Ítem</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Cantidad</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Posterior</th><th>Motivo</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach var="m" items="${movimientos}"><tr><td><fmt:formatDate value="${m.fecha_registro}" pattern="dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss"/></td><td><c:out value="${m.nombre}"/> (<c:out value="${m.codigo}"/>)</td><td>${m.tipo_movimiento}</td><td>${m.cantidad}</td><td>${m.stock_anterior}</td><td>${m.stock_posterior}</td><td><c:out value="${m.observacion}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div><c:if test="${empty movimientos}"><p>Sin movimientos para esta consulta.</p></c:if></section></main></body></html>
